@page "/privacy"
@{ViewData["Title"]="Privacy & enquiries";}
<section class="page-intro compact"><span class="eyebrow">CLEAR & SIMPLE</span><h1>Privacy <em>& enquiries.</em></h1></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Saved favourites and your bag</h2><p>Your favourites and bag are saved in this browser’s local storage. They are not a customer account and do not automatically sync across devices.</p><h2>Your personal enquiry</h2><p>Form details are processed to prepare your message. This preview does not create a customer database, take a payment or confirm an order. Nothing is sent to Zahr Boutique until you choose to send the message yourself.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>An essential security cookie protects the enquiry form. No advertising trackers or third-party analytics are included. Instagram, WhatsApp and Google Maps have their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Collection details</h2><p>Photographs come from the business’s public Instagram material. Descriptive display names may differ from official product references. Prices are shown only when supported by a published source; confirm current prices, sizes, colours, availability, delivery and exchange terms directly with the team.</p><p>This is an independent website demo by WebBloom for owner review.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Contact Zahr Boutique ↗</a></section>
